'''Asiluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] greatly increases his range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.10 Update|Version 8.10]].

