==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Asiluga was a part of two other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Legend of the Nekoluga (Removed Combo)|Legend of the Nekoluga]] and [[Nekoluganomicon (Removed Combo)|Nekoluganomicon]].
*Ironically, his Normal Form has more DPS than his Evolved or True Form.
*Asiluga is the only Luga family member whose Normal Form is faster than both their Evolved and True Form.
*Assassinlan Pasalan has the 2nd longest standing range of all Cat Units, 1st being [[Mamoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Mamolan Pasalan]] with 1,400.
**However, [[The 6th Angel (Uber Rare Cat)|The 6th Angel]] and [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Nerd Cat]] are tied for the highest-effective range at 1,500.
*Similar to the other Nekolugas, its prefix Asi(脚, ''ashi'') is Japanese for the abnormally large feature, in this case its legs.
*Assassinlan Pasalan's name, description and design (most notably the bandages on his arms and bullet holes on his chest) are references to [[wikipedia:Kenshiro|Kenshiro]], the main character of the anime ''[[wikipedia:Fist of the North Star|Fist of the North Star]]''.
*Asiluga's appearance may be based on [[wikipedia:Ashinagatenaga|Ashinaga]], a type of yokai with long legs.
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it's normal description is reused in [[Nekoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Nekoluga]]'s description.

